      "principle": "A marriage not solemnized as per Hindu rites and customs cannot be construed as a legal marriage.",
      "held": "If the marriage is not taken place as per Hindu rites and customs like saptapadi, seven steps, tying thali, toeing mettalu etc., are not followed, it cannot be construed as legal marriage solemnized as per Hindu rites and customs.",
